[Options]
[A.]
<h2>ALLIANCE!</h2>
Mellisa, one of the bullys fighting you, asks for an alliance. Do you agree?<br>

$Button=YES,MissionBegin,school3b
$Button=No,Tell,NoAlliance
$Timeout= 10,Tell,AllianceWithdrawn

[AllianceWithdrawn] 
<p>You waited too long. Mellisa thinks that you're mocking her! She withdraws his offer of alliance, and warns you to prepare for battle!

$Button=To Battle,DoNothing,0 

[NoAlliance] 
<p>You reject her offer of alliance. You want to continue to fight Mellisa!

$Button=To Battle,DoNothing,0 


[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Success!</h2>
<p>
You have successfully beaten Mellisa and Louis!!!

<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0

[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>
Mellisa and Louis have beaten you and Michael to the ground, there is no helping you now. 

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[END]
